<title>FINLAND: ORION AYS DOES NOT FORECAST APPROVALS.</title>
<headline>ORION AYS DOES NOT FORECAST APPROVALS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish pharmaceuticals group Orion-Yhtyma Oy has a policy not to comment on when it expects to gain marketing approval for its products, Orion's Pharma division's president Jyrki Mattila said on Thursday.</p>
<p>He said this in reference to Orion's earlier statement that the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) had requested additional information on its Fareston breast cancer drug.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
